  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Mr. Bruno, also known as The Impostor, is a shapeshifting evil do-er. Serius a.k.a. The Copier, \r\nhas to stop Mr. Bruno, while assisted by Dr. Cyber and his sister, Sara. Skullbot 1101X, \r\na.k.a. Skullby, is a skeleton robot who can cut shit up! Then Tedriss, a giant Tedi from Conker’s Bad Fur Day\r\nwants to rip your head off! Voltang, an electrical unit bot, is a high powered robot capable of fucking\r\nyou up. Meanie, a mean guy is ice-cold, oooooooooooo. Sam Sinister, a tricky kniving bastard of his own self.\r\nLast but not least, Hot Hitt, a demon from Hell, who wants to send you there for eternal damnation, damn it."
    }
  ],
